  "title": "FDA Issues Highest Risk Warning for Recalled Cheese Products Over Listeria Concerns",
  "summary": "Consumers in several U.S. states are being urged to avoid certain cheese products after federal health officials issued the highest risk classification for a recall involving Clover Hill Dairy cheeses. The warning follows concerns that the products may be contaminated with Listeria monocytogenes, a bacteria that can cause serious illness, hospitalization, and in some cases, death. The U.S. Food and Drug Administration (FDA) classified the recall as a Class I event, its most serious recall categ",
